### Reset Password - Using Email Token
POST http://localhost:8080/api/v1/auth/reset-password
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "token": "your-reset-token-here",
  "otp": null,
  "newPassword": "NewSecurePassword123!"
}

###

### Reset Password - Using OTP
POST http://localhost:8080/api/v1/auth/reset-password
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "token": null,
  "otp": "123456",
  "newPassword": "NewSecurePassword123!"
}
